You can alter alta S.A.I.L. by installing one of the official patches: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3277537016]EDS Alta S.A.I.L.[/url], [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3277849874]C.T.O.S. Alta S.A.I.L.[/url].
